# 仓库里统一用 LF，检出时交给各自平台的 core.autocrlf 处理。
# 不统一的话，Windows 上提交一次就会出现整文件的行尾 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：别做行尾转换，也别在 diff 里展开
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.node  binary

# 生成物：GitHub 语言统计里不计入，也不在 PR diff 里默认展开
package-lock.json  linguist-generated=true -diff
resources/dictionaries/rime-ice/base.dict.yaml linguist-vendored=true -text -diff
resources/dictionaries/rime-ice/LICENSE -text
resources/dictionaries/rime-ice/catalog.json linguist-generated=true -diff
